}
```

These tests verify presentation behavior. They do not establish that SwiftData saved or removed a record; test that through the concrete store separately. Add controlled suspension points for cancellation and overlapping-request tests instead of timing-sensitive sleeps.

### Coverage and execution

The required target is **100% within the defined production scope and metrics**, with every production file accounted for. The later supplied requirement supersedes older 80%/90% figures. These three tests do not claim full coverage.

Run the test-enabled shared scheme on the assigned Simulator. Replace the sample values:

